  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "RBL Insignia Preferred Banking World Credit Card is designed for consumers seeking travel, lifestyle, and reward benefits through regular spends. Cardholders can earn 5 reward points for every Rs. 100 spent domestically and 10 reward points per Rs. 100 spent internationally. The card also offers alow forex markup fee of 1.5% , making it suitable for overseas transactions. Travel-related benefits include complimentary domestic and international airport lounge access, along with additional visits based on monthly spending milestones. Cardholders can also access privileges at premium hotel brands worldwide, including room upgrades, breakfast benefits, and flexible check-in and check-out options. Other features include welcome reward points, annual milestone vouchers, discounts on movie tickets, dining offers through EazyDiner, and wellness-related benefits such as health assessments and discounts on nutrition and wellness programs. These benefits make the card suitable for frequent travellers and lifestyle-focused consumers.",
    "highlights": [
      "RBL Insignia Preferred Banking World Cards",
      "5 reward points per Rs. 100 spent domestically",
